Subject: [PATCH] Amendments A1-A3 and items 4-12 (indivisible block). A1:
 n_signals_d removed from depth_yield_direction and all four call sites - a
 parameter named after the divisor item 13 deleted, sitting on the objective,
 is an invitation to reintroduce it. A2: dead imports split_output and shutil
 removed from master.py (split_output itself and rebuild.py --chunk-mb both
 survive - they split INPUT data). A3: _LEGACY_RESULTS_DIR deleted. Item 4:
 cluster runs count DISTINCT signals, built PER DIRECTION - measured
 1.8/15.4/26.1% per-direction against 27.6% pooled at N=30, reproducing the
 spec exactly; cluster_runs and same_signal_refire_rate added. Items 5-12: new
 engine/catalogue.py plus stage S5D emitting one catalogue per family from the
 Appendix C VALID predicate with UNEVALUABLE rows retained and reason codes,
 coverage against BOTH raw-terrain and REACHABLE denominators computed per
 grid cell, touched-episode IDs, the eight Appendix A pricing columns with
 Benjamini-Yekutieli, segment-local folds, gated and ungated arms with the
 delta, the unclaimed-reachable set, the same-bar cohort curve and the
 dilution curve under two ranking keys.

